ion" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-4617d3d0-3ffa-59f8-bebe-9f1b4563ee42" :answer-field/choices ["answer-cf19757d-7c06-5aab-9d24-02031f634cd9" "answer-7189fd7d-69c5-59f4-9504-860c0442c666" "answer-9a4ce621-af37-5381-8d15-204b6ac865ce" "answer-4617d3d0-3ffa-59f8-bebe-9f1b4563ee42" "answer-62bb9ba1-65af-5dbd-86ad-fd392199db41"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-cf19757d-7c06-5aab-9d24-02031f634cd9" :answer/id #uuid "cf19757d-7c06-5aab-9d24-02031f634cd9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(¬P∧Q)∨R" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7189fd7d-69c5-59f4-9504-860c0442c666" :answer/id #uuid "7189fd7d-69c5-59f4-9504-860c0442c666" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(¬P∨Q)∧R" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9a4ce621-af37-5381-8d15-204b6ac865ce" :answer/id #uuid "9a4ce621-af37-5381-8d15-204b6ac865ce" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(¬P∨Q)∨R" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4617d3d0-3ffa-59f8-bebe-9f1b4563ee42" :answer/id #uuid "4617d3d0-3ffa-59f8-bebe-9f1b4563ee42" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(¬P∨R)∧Q" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-62bb9ba1-65af-5dbd-86ad-fd392199db41" :answer/id #uuid "62bb9ba1-65af-5dbd-86ad-fd392199db41" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "¬P∨(Q∧R)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "activity-c1660eca-e139-5686-9782-99e1cae0d92e" :activity/id #uuid "c1660eca-e139-5686-9782-99e1cae0d92e" :activity/title "Quiz 5" :activity/type :activity.type/assessment :activity/course 17592186046658 :activity/steps ["step-773ecc3f-347e-51a4-aa4e-8e6fe98247d8" "step-2ba69236-63ce-5e86-bc2d-fc9e6a6ed08f" "step-8d34645a-0ab4-52e4-8b35-bc0e3d610aa7" "step-8fdb4546-c1ce-56f8-99f7-175189831b5c" "step-e8e35945-97d6-5cc1-b14c-bebae6d5504a" "step-33347817-cc49-5766-869f-ba7c79f13e79" "step-282fa0dd-941b-516f-838f-7d24582c01b9"] :activity/first-step "step-773ecc3f-347e-51a4-aa4e-8e6fe98247d8" :db/ensure [:activity/validate]} {:db/id "step-773ecc3f-347e-51a4-aa4e-8e6fe98247d8" :step/id #uuid "773ecc3f-347e-51a4-aa4e-8e6fe98247d8" :step/content 17592186134541 :step/next "step-2ba69236-63ce-5e86-bc2d-fc9e6a6ed08f" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-2ba69236-63ce-5e86-bc2d-fc9e6a6ed08f" :step/id #uuid "2ba69236-63ce-5e86-bc2d-fc9e6a6ed08f" :step/content "question-62a31be5-1f88-5fce-bc3d-c7a604a6e638" :step/next "step-8d34645a-0ab4-52e4-8b35-bc0e3d610aa7" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-8d34645a-0ab4-52e4-8b35-bc0e3d610aa7" :step/id #uuid "8d34645a-0ab4-52e4-8b35-bc0e3d610aa7" :step/content "question-6d3ae80f-587f-5674-9679-5efb33bf0d2c" :step/next "step-8fdb4546-c1ce-56f8-99f7-175189831b5c" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-8fdb4546-c1ce-56f8-99f7-175189831b5c" :step/id #uuid "8fdb4546-c1ce-56f8-99f7-175189831b5c" :step/content 17592186342160 :step/next "step-e8e35945-97d6-5cc1-b14c-bebae6d5504a" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-e8e35945-97d6-5cc1-b14c-bebae6d5504a" :step/id #uuid "e8e35945-97d6-5cc1-b14c-bebae6d5504a" :step/content 17592186272029 :step/next "step-33347817-cc49-5766-869f-ba7c79f13e79" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-33347817-cc49-5766-869f-ba7c79f13e79" :step/id #uuid "33347817-cc49-5766-869f-ba7c79f13e79" :step/content "question-8da6073f-aed1-5284-a635-95231dda9375" :step/next "step-282fa0dd-941b-516f-838f-7d24582c01b9" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-282fa0dd-941b-516f-838f-7d24582c01b9" :step/id #uuid "282fa0dd-941b-516f-838f-7d24582c01b9" :step/content "question-d785d990-0971-50ad-9ff0-c1525a2beb2a" :db/ensure [:step/validate]}] "assertions" [[17592186134541 :question/problem "Given that the random variable $X$ has the probability density function\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\frac{{e}^{-|x/2|}}{4},\\,x\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ),\n$$\n\nits cumulative distribution function is \n\n$$\nF(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{e}^{x/2}}{2},\\, & x<0 \\\\ h(x),\\, & x\\ge 0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFind the function $h(x).$"] [17592186134541 :question/worked-solution "Since our random variable $X$ has a probability distribution function $f(x)$ that involves an absolute value, the cumulative distribution function takes the following form:\n\n$$\nF(x)=P(X\\le x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{x}\\frac{{e}^{t/2}}{4}\\,\\text{d}t, & x<0 \\\\ {\\int }_{-\\infty }^{0}\\frac{{e}^{t/2}}{4}\\,\\text{d}t+{\\int }_{0}^{x}\\frac{{e}^{-t/2}}{4}\\,\\text{d}t, & x\\ge 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's compute the integrals.\n\n- If $x\\le 0,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{x}\\frac{{e}^{t/2}}{4}\\,\\text{d}t & ={\\frac{{e}^{t/2}}{2}|}_{-\\infty }^{x} \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{x/2}}{2},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{0}\\frac{{e}^{t/2}}{4}\\,\\text{d}t & ={\\frac{{e}^{t/2}}{2}|}_{x=0} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- If $x>0,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{x}\\frac{{e}^{-t/2}}{4}\\,\\text{d}t & =-{\\frac{{e}^{-t/2}}{2}|}_{0}^{x} \\\\  & =-\\frac{{e}^{-x/2}}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAs a result, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{0}\\frac{{e}^{-t/2}}{4}\\,\\text{d}t+{\\int }_{0}^{x}\\frac{{e}^{-t/2}}{4}\\,\\text{d}t & =\\frac{1}{2}+(-\\frac{{e}^{-x/2}}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}) \\\\  & =1-\\frac{{e}^{-x/2}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the cumulative distribution function is given by\n\n$$\nF(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{e}^{x/2}}{2}, & x<0 \\\\ 1-\\frac{{e}^{-x/2}}{2}, & x\\ge 0.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [17592186134541 :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-b905210f-a059-572c-8e25-2b36e139ca53" :answer/id #uuid "b905210f-a059-572c-8e25-2b36e139ca53"] ["answer-b905210f-a059-572c-8e25-2b36e139ca53" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-b905210f-a059-572c-8e25-2b36e139ca53" :answer/value "1-\\frac{{e}^{-x/2}}{2}"] ["answer-128e3b85-4be0-58d5-9120-cf5364e7369e" :answer/id #uuid "128e3b85-4be0-58d5-9120-cf5364e7369e"] ["answer-128e3b85-4be0-58d5-9120-cf5364e7369e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-128e3b85-4be0-58d5-9120-cf5364e7369e" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{{e}^{-x/2}}{2}"] ["answer-82c39e58-8d46-563b-b847-882b5527d6e1" :answer/id #uuid "82c39e58-8d46-563b-b847-882b5527d6e1"] ["answer-82c39e58-8d46-563b-b847-882b5527d6e1" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-82c39e58-8d46-563b-b847-882b5527d6e1" :answer/value "\\frac{{e}^{-x/2}}{2}"] ["answer-c09d67cf-c692-53b9-9009-9755c3847a2d" :answer/id #uuid "c09d67cf-c692-53b9-9009-9755c3847a2d"] ["answer-c09d67cf-c692-53b9-9009-9755c3847a2d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-c09d67cf-c692-53b9-9009-9755c3847a2d" :answer/value "\\frac{{e}^{-x/2}}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}"] ["answer-9b72f51e-b7fa-5eaa-b4a9-881ec5d3b1ce" :answer/id #uuid "9b72f51e-b7fa-5eaa-b4a9-881ec5d3b1ce"] ["answer-9b72f51e-b7fa-5eaa-b4a9-881ec5d3b1ce" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-9b72f51e-b7fa-5eaa-b4a9-881ec5d3b1ce" :answer/value "\\frac{{e}^{-x/2}}{2}-1"] [17592186133284 :answer-field/correct "answer-b905210f-a059-572c-8e25-2b36e139ca53"] [17592186133284 :answer-field/choices "answer-b905210f-a059-572c-8e25-2b36e139ca53"] [17592186133284 :answer-field/choices "answer-128e3b85-4be0-58d5-9120-cf5364e7369e"] [17592186133284 :answer-field/choices "answer-82c39e58-8d46-563b-b847-882b5527d6e1"] [17592186133284 :answer-field/choices "answer-c09d67cf-c692-53b9-9009-9755c3847a2d"] [17592186133284 :answer-field/choices "answer-9b72f51e-b7fa-5eaa-b4a9-881ec5d3b1ce"] ["question-62a31be5-1f88-5fce-bc3d-c7a604a6e638" :question/id #uuid "62a31be5-1f88-5fce-bc3d-c7a604a6e638"] ["question-62a31be5-1f88-5fce-bc3d-c7a604a6e638" :question/math-academy-id "q-72402"] ["question-62a31be5-1f88-5fce-bc3d-c7a604a6e638" :question/problem "${\\sum }_{i=1}^{3}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{2}({i}^{2}-{j}^{2})=$"] ["question-62a31be5-1f88-5fce-bc3d-c7a604a6e638" :question/worked-solution "First, we write out the inner summation by summing over the index $j:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{3}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{2}({i}^{2}-{j}^{2}) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{3}[{\\sum }_{j=1}^{2}({i}^{2}-{j}^{2})] \\\\  & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{3}(({i}^{2}-{1}^{2})+({i}^{2}-{2}^{2})) \\\\  & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{3}(({i}^{2}-1)+({i}^{2}-4)) \\\\  & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{3}(2{i}^{2}-5)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we sum over the index $i:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{3}(2{i}^{2}-5) & =(2(1)^{2}-5)+(2(2)^{2}-5)+(2(3)^{2}-5) \\\\  & =-3+3+13 \\\\  & =13\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-62a31be5-1f88-5fce-bc3d-c7a604a6e638" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-cb74bb6d-eb9e-5168-b33b-f718103e0618" :answer-field/id #uuid "cb74bb6d-eb9e-5168-b33b-f718103e0618"] ["answer-f93f673f-1cdf-5fcb-8a52-d4d7a60f012f" :answer/id #uuid "f93f673f-1cdf-5fcb-8a52-d4d7a60f012f"] ["answer-f93f673f-1cdf-5fcb-8a52-d4d7a60f012f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-f93f673f-1cdf-5fcb-8a52-d4d7a60f012f" :answer/value "0"] ["answer-135c1c58-72fd-5e33-bb89-e656d31fd58a" :answer/id #uuid "135c1c58-72fd-5e33-bb89-e656d31fd58a"] ["answer-135c1c58-72fd-5e33-bb89-e656d31fd58a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-135c1c58-72fd-5e33-bb89-e656d31fd58a" :answer/value "13"] ["answer-8f64f0ed-c125-50ec-80b4-0baad2e5331e" :answer/id #uuid "8f64f0ed-c125-50ec-80b4-0baad2e5331e"] ["answer-8f64f0ed-c125-50ec-80b4-0baad2e5331e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-8f64f0ed-c125-50ec-80b4-0baad2e5331e" :answer/value "19"] ["answer-8fdbc633-5f94-527c-beb7-ec30a2b7cea8" :answer/id #uuid "8fdbc633-5f94-527c-beb7-ec30a2b7cea8"] ["answer-8fdbc633-5f94-527c-beb7-ec30a2b7cea8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-8fdbc633-5f94-527c-beb7-ec30a2b7cea8" :answer/value "3"] ["answer-8b3283bc-9a97-5ab1-beab-d6945922e38d" :answer/id #uuid "8b3283bc-9a97-5ab1-beab-d6945922e38d"] ["answer-8b3283bc-9a97-5ab1-beab-d6945922e38d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-8b3283bc-9a97-5ab1-beab-d6945922e38d" :answer/value "6"] ["answer-field-cb74bb6d-eb9e-5168-b33b-f718103e0618" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-cb74bb6d-eb9e-5168-b33b-f718103e0618" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-cb74bb6d-eb9e-5168-b33b-f718103e0618" :answer-field/correct "answer-135c1c58-72fd-5e33-bb89-e656d31fd58a"] ["answer-field-cb74bb6d-eb9e-5168-b33b-f718103e0618" :answer-field/choices "answer-f93f673f-1cdf-5fcb-8a52-d4d7a60f012f"] ["answer-field-cb74bb6d-eb9e-5168-b33b-f718103e0618" :answer-field/choices "answer-135c1c58-72fd-5e33-bb89-e656d31fd58a"] ["answer-field-cb74bb6d-eb9e-5168-b33b-f718103e0618" :answer-field/choices "answer-8f64f0ed-c125-50ec-80b4-0baad2e5331e"] ["answer-field-cb74bb6d-eb9e-5168-b33b-f718103e0618" :answer-field/choices "answer-8fdbc633-5f94-527c-beb7-ec30a2b7cea8"] ["answer-field-cb74bb6d-eb9e-5168-b33b-f718103e0618" :answer-field/choices "answer-8b3283bc-9a97-5ab1-beab-d6945922e38d"] ["question-62a31be5-1f88-5fce-bc3d-c7a604a6e638" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-cb74bb6d-eb9e-5168-b33b-f718103e0618"] [17592186129173 :knowledge-point/questions "question-62a31be5-1f88-5fce-bc3d-c7a604a6e638"] ["question-6d3ae80f-587f-5674-9679-5efb33bf0d2c" :question/id #uuid "6d3ae80f-587f-5674-9679-5efb33bf0d2c"] ["question-6d3ae80f-587f-5674-9679-5efb33bf0d2c" :question/math-academy-id "q-157227"] ["question-6d3ae80f-587f-5674-9679-5efb33bf0d2c" :question/problem "Consider the following vectors:\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],\\,{a}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 6 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],\\,{a}_{3}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nI. $-3{a}_{1}+{a}_{2}+2{a}_{3}=0.$\n\nII. ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=0$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0.$\n\nIII. The set $\\{{a}_{1},{a}_{2},{a}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent."] ["question-6d3ae80f-587f-5674-9679-5efb33bf0d2c" :question/worked-solution "We say that three vectors ${v}_{1},{v}_{2}$ and ${v}_{3}$ are *linearly independent* if the only solution to the equation\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}{v}_{1}+{x}_{2}{v}_{2}+{x}_{3}{v}_{3}=0\n$$\n\nis ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0.$ Otherwise, the vectors are *linearly dependent*.\n\nWith that in mind, let's look at each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is false. Indeed:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-3{a}_{1}+{a}_{2}+2{a}_{3} & =-3[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 6 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+2[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-12 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 6 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 10\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-12+0+2 \\\\ 3+6+4 \\\\ 0+0+10\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-10 \\\\ 13 \\\\ 10\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & \\ne 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement II is true. The equation ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=0$ corresponds to the system\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}4{x}_{1}+{x}_{3}=0 \\\\ -{x}_{1}+6{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3}=0 \\\\ 5{x}_{3}=0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that we can reorder the equations in this system as follows:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{1}+6{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3}=0 \\\\ 4{x}_{1}+{x}_{3}=0 \\\\ 5{x}_{3}=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSolving this system using back substitution, we find that the solution is ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0.$\n\n- Statement III is true. Since statement II is true, the set $\\{{a}_{1},{a}_{2},{a}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\""] ["question-6d3ae80f-587f-5674-9679-5efb33bf0d2c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] ["answer-field-993bd62a-640e-5656-8035-d20d8bad796e" :answer-field/id #uuid "993bd62a-640e-5656-8035-d20d8bad796e"] ["answer-14d3b9a6-b42e-5d81-b5e8-d7e65c357f71" :answer/id #uuid "14d3b9a6-b42e-5d81-b5e8-d7e65c357f71"] ["answer-14d3b9a6-b42e-5d81-b5e8-d7e65c357f71" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-14d3b9a6-b42e-5d81-b5e8-d7e65c357f71" :answer/value "I and II only"] ["answer-d63d1670-ebb4-54f4-afea-a48835538de1" :answer/id #uuid "d63d1670-ebb4-54f4-afea-a48835538de1"] ["answer-d63d